Acceptance criteria claimed and covered (all through the public API only):
  AC-20 no tax truth produced, proved three ways:
        - the accepted result is not an instance of T4Slip, T4MappingResult,
          or TaxLineEntry
        - a reflection walk proves no public property of ValidatedExtraction
          is assignable to any of those types
        - the payload is reference-identical down to its Boxes list, with box
          values surviving byte-for-byte (untrimmed whitespace, thousands
          separator, null value), which a parsed/normalized/rounded payload
          could not be
  AC-21 a payload the engine would reject four ways (duplicate code,
        non-numeric amount, unknown code, null value) still clears the gate
  AC-22 accepted envelope with Box 12 = 123456789 and populated identity
        fields: retained unmasked in memory, absent from every ToString()
        and every supported direct JSON serialization
  AC-23 mandatory omission matrix end-to-end: 10 plant slots x (3 SIN forms
        + 2 non-numeric markers) over an accepted envelope and 11 rejection
        families; absent from Field, Message, every ToString(), and JSON.
        Includes an all-at-once case with a SIN in Box 12 and distinct
        markers in all ten caller-controlled fields simultaneously.
  AC-25 exhaustive 4x4 envelope-year x payload-year matrix (null/2024/2025/
        2026): accepted iff both are 2025, neither value coerced in any of
        the sixteen cases; plus the three cases the criterion names and a
        generic-evidence year-isolation check
  AC-28 replay determinism over 4 accepted and 11 rejected cases, 5 replays
        each, asserting equal error ORDERING (not merely set equality),
        agreement between distinct-but-equivalent envelopes, and that
        validation mutates neither envelope nor payload
Anti-vacuity measures:
  - a reachability test asserts every plant slot is readable back off the
    accepted result, so a mis-wired slot fails loudly instead of letting the
    omission assertions pass vacuously
  - non-numeric markers supplement the SIN forms, because a nine-digit regex
    cannot catch an echoed document id or source reference
Ingress port: exercised via a minimal test-only adapter declared inside
  ExtractionAcceptanceTests, as T03 permits. The same test re-asserts the
  production assembly contains no implementor of IDocumentExtractionIngress.
  No production implementation was added.
